{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["金灯台和橄榄树"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那位与我说话的天使又来唤醒我，像唤醒睡觉的人一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他问我：“你看见了什么？” 我说：“我看见一个纯金的灯台，灯台顶端有一个油碗，灯台上有七盏灯，每盏灯有七个灯芯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["灯台旁边有两棵橄榄树，左右各一棵。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我问与我说话的天使：“主啊，这是什么意思？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他说：“你不知道吗？”我说：“主啊，我不知道。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他对我说：“这是耶和华对所罗巴伯讲的话。万军之耶和华说，‘不靠权势，不靠才能，乃靠我的灵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["大山啊，你算什么？你必在所罗巴伯面前化为平地。他必搬出那块封殿顶的石头，伴随着欢呼声：愿恩典、恩典归于这殿！’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["“所罗巴伯的手已经奠立这殿的根基，他的手也必完成这项工程。那时你便知道，是万军之耶和华差遣我到你们这里来的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["谁敢藐视这微不足道的日子？他们看见所罗巴伯手中拿着线锤时，就必欢喜。这七盏灯是耶和华遍察天下的眼睛。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我又问天使：“灯台左右的两棵橄榄树是什么意思？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["然后我又问道：“流出金色橄榄油的两个金管旁边的两根橄榄枝是什么意思？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他说：“你不知道吗？”我说：“主啊，我不知道。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他说：“这是侍立在天下之主旁边的两位受膏者。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}